        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur EADSWPLTT2, French Colonial Egg and Dart Toggle Plate for Two Switches</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Grandeur Egg and Dart Double Toggle Switch Plate has a lovely floral pattern along the edge that is typical of French Colonial design, making it an excellent choice for traditional and historic homes. The Egg & Dart design looks great in almost every finish, but it really shines in authentic finishes such as antique brass and antique pewter. This French Colonial Egg and Dart Toggle Plate for Two Switches comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Egg & Dart Toggle Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
